# Built in Gateway Forge. A template is a recipe: `use <segment>` steps in
# order, interleaved with the session-level surf and bed cues that segments
# are forbidden to carry. Edit it here or in the app -- it is the same file.
#
# The affirmation is the 1977 original rather than the settled form: the
# route enters F23, F25, F26, F34 and F35, which levels.json marks as populated by minds
# the listener did not choose. The tape's own preparatory process is
# expanded through reusable components, so which affirmation fills that
# slot is this library's choice and not a claim about the source.

@title    f42-I-There cluster
@level    F1
@ending   stay
@pan      right
@verbosity 3
@seed     718237

surf 0.55
use opening
use comfort
use orientation
use ocean

surf 0.30
use conversion-box
use resonant-tuning
surf 0.18
use affirmation-1977
use balloon


surf 0.0
use relax-10
use climb-f10-f12
pause 10
use climb-f12-f15
pause 10
use climb-f15-f21
pause 10
use climb-f21-f23
pause 10
use climb-f23-f25
pause 10
use climb-f25-f26
pause 10
use climb-f26-f27
pause 10
use climb-f27-f34
pause 10
use climb-f34-f35
pause 10
use climb-f35-f42
use briefing-f42
hold 1800
use stay
